From 4cad4fe078fde5f244ec2abb8895edc190166622 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xInterlopeRx <jkirk777@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:57:19 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(core): add Nous Portal device-code OAuth provider

Add Nous Research Portal sign-in (OAuth device-code flow) with token
refresh and model discovery. Registers a "Nous Portal device code" auth
method, polls the device-code grant, rotates the refresh token on
refresh, and discovers v1/models from allowlisted inference hosts.

Includes tests covering method registration, the connect-poll-refresh-
discovery flow, rotated refresh tokens, hermes-model filtering, and
rejection of non-allowlisted inference base URLs.
